mission.text:
Mission: Create exactly one customer with the specified attributes and verify that the customer exists.

Customer attributes:
{
  "email": "dorothy@langley.example",
  "metadata": {
    "region": "us-east",
    "tier": "gold"
  },
  "name": "Dorothy Vaughan"
}

When you are finished, call submit_final_claim.

